Description: Jazzy-compatible backport of Nav2's dynamic object following action server (opennav_following, originally developed for the navigation2 &quot;main&quot; branch by Open Navigation LLC and Alberto J.
 Tudela Roldán). Self-contained: ships its own FollowObject action so it installs standalone on ROS 2 Jazzy.
